{"id":"656630","name":"番茄土豆炖牛腩","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656630/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腩","amount":"适量"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨牛腩洗净改刀切块。","img":"images/656630/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜切片。","img":"images/656630/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛腩冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/656630/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油把姜片炒香。","img":"images/656630/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入牛腩翻炒。","img":"images/656630/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量老抽，蚝油炒匀上色。","img":"images/656630/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/656630/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将牛腩转入珐琅锅中。","img":"images/656630/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上煮开小火焖45分钟。","img":"images/656630/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"番茄洗净切块。","img":"images/656630/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切块。","img":"images/656630/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分钟后放入一部分番茄，继续焖20分钟。","img":"images/656630/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"土豆下锅焖至断生。","img":"images/656630/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"少许盐调味。","img":"images/656630/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后放入剩下的番茄煲2分钟左右即可。","img":"images/656630/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656630/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656630/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}